# autoresearch reads no environment variables.
#
# Every run setting lives in source:
#   prepare.py -> TIME_BUDGET, MAX_SEQ_LEN, VOCAB_SIZE, EVAL_TOKENS
#   train.py   -> DEPTH, DEVICE_BATCH_SIZE, TOTAL_BATCH_SIZE, learning rates
#
# This template carries no values; it exists only so `cp .env.example .env`
# stays valid for docker compose.
